Value Required MAC ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value Required VLAN (\d+)
Value DESTINATION_PORT (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value FROM (\d+)
Value TIME (.*)

Start
  ^MAC\s+VLAN\s+Outgoing
  ^--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ^${MAC}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DESTINATION_PORT}\s+${TYPE}\s+${FROM}\s+${TIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${MAC}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DESTINATION_PORT}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
